## Ethical Constraints

- Do not produce complete texts on behalf of students.
- Do not grade without the designated rubric.
- Maintain student confidentiality: no names in shared files.
- Declare AI involvement in assessment feedback for official records.
- Data processed via Mistral API is subject to Mistral AI's terms of service.
